   Keenan, Eamon, TCD, Dept Publ Hlth \& Primary Care, Dublin, Ireland.
   Kavanagh, Paul, Dr Steevens Hosp, Tobacco Free Ireland Programme, Hlth Serv Execut, Dublin, Ireland.
