Number = {1-2, SI},
Pages = {1-8},
Month = {JAN},
Abstract = {This editorial presents an introduction to and an overview of the
   current JIDR special issue on ``Executive Function in Intellectual
   Disability.{''} The articles included in this special issue provide a
   contemporary, in depth exploration of questions regarding the nature of
   EF in individuals with ID. Topics include the emergence of EF during
   early childhood in ID-related conditions, the influence of EF on other
   domains of development, and the relationship between EF and adaptation
   throughout the lifespan. This editorial synthesizes the findings
   presented in this special issue and identifies methodological challenges
   that researchers will continue to face in future investigations of this
   important area.},
